th outstanding performance. Shot blasted sprockets with improved surface fatigue strength. Sprockets are made of best surface protection treatment which enables to withstand dust and muddy ride with ease. Sprockets are of made with best position accuracy to ensure better fitment capabilities. Good surface finish that makes ride smoother. Chain R520HPOR-114-24a:T67e,Rolon Brass Chain Sprocket For DUKE 390 GEN 3-HXRC 453NF Upgrade your KTM Duke 390 Gen 3 with the Rolon Brass Chain Sprocket Kit (HXRC 453NF) — a high-performance, noise-free solution designed for durability, smoother rides, and enhanced power transfer. With precision engineering and brass-finished aesthetics, this kit stands out both in function and form. Key Features:- Brass-Coated Chain:Enhanced corrosion resistance and a premium look with a durable brass finish. Precision Front \\u0026 Rear Sprockets:CNC-machined for high accuracy and balanced power delivery. Low Noise \\u0026 Vibration:Engineered for smooth, quiet performance — ideal for daily rides or high-speed cruising. High-Quality Chain Links:Sealed ring technology (likely X-Ring or O-Ring) for longer chain life and lower maintenance. OE-Spec Fitment:Direct fit with KTM Duke 390 Gen 3 drivetrain — no modifications needed. Enhanced Heat Treatment:Increases wear resistance and sprocket life under high-torque conditions. Specifications:- Component Details Model Code HXRC 453NF Compatible Bike KTM Duke 390 Gen 3 (2024+) Chain Type Brass-Coated X-Ring Chain Number of Links 111+1 (approx., bike-specific) Front Sprocket 14 Teeth (standard range) Rear Sprocket 43 Teeth (bike-dependent) Material High-tensile Steel (Sprockets), Brass-finished Chain Noise Control Yes – Engineered for silent performance Surface Finish Zinc + Brass Coating Durability Level Extended lifespan with advanced metallurgy Ideal For:- Riders seeking better longevity and aesthetic appeal. Daily commuters and touring riders who demand consistent performance. KTM owners who prefer OE-fit upgrades with a premium finish.4b:T62a,Rolon Chain Sprocket Kit For RE-Guerrilla 450-SOR 438NF Enhance your riding experience with the Rolon Chain Sprocket Kit, meticulously designed for the Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450. This kit offers a seamless blend of durability, performance, and noise-free operation, ensuring a smoother and more reliable ride across diverse terrains. Key Features:- Premium Construction: Crafted from high-grade materials, this kit ensures longevity and optimal performance. Noise-Free Operation: Engineered to minimize vibrations and reduce noise, providing a quieter ride. Corrosion Resistance: Coated with protective layers to resist rust and wear, extending the lifespan of the components. Precision Fitment: Designed for a perfect fit on the Guerrilla 450, ensuring easy installation and compatibility. Enhanced Power Delivery: Optimized sprocket ratios for improved torque and acceleration. Specifications:- Component Specification Model Code SOR 438NF Compatible Bike Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 Brand Rolon Front Sprocket 15 Teeth (Z=15) Rear Sprocket 45 Teeth (Z=45) Chain Type X-Ring Number of Links 114 (Standard length) Material High-strength Alloy Steel (Carbon-treated) Finish Zinc-coated, Shot-blasted for durability Noise Reduction Yes – Noise-Free Engineering Weight Approx. 2.5 kg Fitment OEM-Compatible Ideal For:- Daily Commuters: Ensures consistent performance and longevity for everyday rides. Touring Enthusiasts: Provides reliability and comfort during long-distance Riders Seeking Upgrades: Ideal for those looking to enhance their bike's performance and aesthetics.4c:T5b2,ROLON is the pioneer of high-quality motorbike chains and sprockets. The anti-resistance quality of the chain makes the product reliable for the usage in any vehicle. Rolon places great emphasis on R\\u0026D, which has the facility of Pro-E, CAD \\u0026 CAM. The Government recognized R\\u0026D facility is equipped with state-of-the-art equipment for the testing of raw materials and finished products. Rolon GOLD-X-Ring Chain Sprocket Kit- KTM DUKE 200 (2014 Onwards) / RC200 Part number: HPXRC267 Chain: 110L Front Sprocket Theet:14 Rear Sprocket Teeth:42 Rear Sproket hole: 6 Maintenance Clean the chain with Kerosin or Liqui Moly chain cleaner Lube the chain with Liqui Moly fully synthetic chain lube or gear oil 90 Clean and Lube the chain every 450-600 Km depend upon weather and riding condition Salient Features BRASS PLATED CHAIN Corrosion Resistant Lustrous Aesthetic Enhanced Wear Resistance due to Quadruple Sealed Rings Simplified Cleaning SPROCKET Enhanced Wear Resistance High Fatigue Strength Outstanding Durability RUBBERIZED FRONT SPROCKET Noise Free Acts as a Damper DO'S Regular lubrication of sealed ring chain should be done for every 500 km Always clean and dry the chain before lubrication. Clean the chain using soft cloth Use ROLON chain clean and ROLON white lube for better performance DON'T'S Don't use coarse stiff brushes for chain cleaning. Don't use petrol , thinner for cleaning the chain. Don't use pressurized water, air and oil on chains4d:T775,Rolon Noise-Free Chain Sprocket Kit for KTM Duke 250 Gen 3 (HXR F 460NF) Product Code: HXR F 460NF Compatibility: KTM Duke 250 Gen 3 Configuration: Front Sprocket: 14 Teeth Rear Sprocket: 43 Teeth Chain Links: 112-2 Upgrade your motorcycle’s drivetrain with the Rolon Noise-Free Chain Sprocket Kit, meticulously engineered for the KTM Duke 250 Gen 3. This high-performance kit ensures smooth power transmission, reduced noise, and exceptional durability—ideal for both urban commutes and challenging terrains. Front Sprocket Features: Precision Engineering: OE-spec fitment ensures perfect alignment and seamless integration with the bike’s drivetrain. Anti-Wear Technology: Delivers smoother power delivery while minimizing wear over time. Durability Built-In: Heat-treated and coated for maximum strength, corrosion resistance, and longevity. Enhanced Ride Quality: Noise- and vibration-reduction design provides a quieter, more comfortable ride. Quality Assurance: Subjected to 18 production stages and 15 rigorous quality checks for reliable performance. Rear Sprocket Highlights: Premium Construction: Crafted from high-strength carbon steel to withstand heavy loads and rough conditions. Induction-Hardened Teeth: Offers extended life and superior resistance to wear and deformation. Corrosion Protection: Zinc coating prevents rust and extends durability in all weather conditions. Optimized Design: Precision-fit machining ensures accurate chain alignment and smooth rotation. Surface Treatment: Shot-blasted and treated to repel dust, mud, and debris for low-maintenance performance. Why Choose Rolon? With a legacy of innovation and quality, Rolon delivers drivetrain components trusted by professionals and performance enthusiasts alike. This sprocket kit not only ensures superior mechanical efficiency but also elevates your riding experience with its noise-free, low-maintenance operation.4e:T640,Rolon Noise Free Chain Sprocket Kit for Triumph Speed 400/ Scrambler 400 HXR 427NF The Rolon HXR 427NF Chain Sprocket Kit is designed to offer a smooth, noise-free, and long-lasting drivetrain experience for Triumph Speed 400 and Scrambler 400 motorcycles. Precision-engineered components ensure OE-spec fitment, superior durability, and reduced vibration, making it ideal for both daily commutes and rugged rides. Kit Includes: Front Sprocket – 15 Teeth Rear Sprocket – 43 Teeth Chain – 103 Links (Noise-Free Design) Front Sprocket Features: Manufactured with high-quality, heat-treated steel for enhanced strength and wear resistance Anti-wear technology improves power transmission and ensures smoother acceleration Precision-machined to reduce noise and vibration for a more comfortable ride Anti-corrosion coating for extended life and reliable performance Rigorously tested through 18 production stages and 15 quality checks OE-spec design ensures perfect compatibility with the motorcycle's drivetrain Rear Sprocket Features: Constructed from premium carbon steel for high strength and durability Induction-hardened teeth for exceptional wear resistance Zinc coating for superior rust prevention in all weather conditions Shot-blasted finish increases fatigue strength for off-road and muddy terrains Optimized tooth geometry for accurate fitment and smooth power delivery Advanced surface treatment resists dust, debris, and mud buildup Low-friction surface finish for quieter and more efficient performance Fitment: Triumph Speed 400 Triumph Scrambler 400 Additional Info:- Weight 2 kg4f:T790,Front Sprocket Reliable with high performance \\u0026 longer life. Smooth operation \\u0026 higher transmission accuracy. Anti-resistant coating with Superior quality. Anti-wear performance which lets vehicle move with full power. Produced with Hi-Tech accurate machining which reduces noise and provides smoother riding. The fitment of the product is as per OE specification. Heat treated and hand finished to perfection. Every sprocket goes through 18 production stages and 15 individual quality control checks before it is ready to leave the manufacturing facility. Rear Sprocket Sprockets are manufactured from carbon steel material with duly induction hardened teeth. Sprockets are only made using the best available materials. Zinc coating to provide better rust prevention. Induction hardening to improve wear resistance with outstanding performance. Shot blasted sprockets with improved surface fatigue strength. Sprockets are made of best surface protection treatment which enables to withstand dust and muddy ride with ease. Sprockets are of made with best position accuracy to ensure better fitment capabilities. Good surface finish that makes ride smoother. Chain Maintenance Lubricate the Chain using ROLON Chain Lube for every 500km in Seal ring chains and every 1000km for Standard Chains. Clean the Chain using ROLON Chain Clean Spray. Every 2500 -3000 km's once chain should be cleaned and then re lubricated. Use nylon brush or soft cloth before lubricating the Chain. Avoid usage of Steel wire brushes to Clean Chain. Don't use petrol,thinner and hot water for cleaning,and high pressure water jet direct contact to seal ring chain should be avoided. Make sure your chain should be in adequate chain slackness - 1 inch min. Dampers should be changed while chain sprocket replacement for better life of Chain Kit. Wear Helmet for Safety - Follow Traffic Rules. Pack Contains Pack Contents one Rear Sprocket, Front Sprocket, Chain.50:T5ed,DID Chain 520 Pitch x 114 links (VX3) Natural Steel - 520VX3X-114ZB VX Series Superior Strength D.I.D's #1 VX Series includes chains for numerous street and off-road motorcycles. Longer Wear Life D.I.D's VX Series boasts a much longer chain life than the VO Series due to the patented X-Ring technology. The 520VX3 has a 32% longer chain life than the 520VO and the 525 and 530VX3 have a 41% longer chain life! Patented X-Ring The VX chain series showcases the industry-leading, patented X-Ring seal technology, which leads to extended chain life, minimal friction, and overall amazing performance. MANUFACTURER: DAIDO KOGYO CO LTD | COUNTRY OF IMPORT: JAPAN Features VX3 Rivet Type Color - Natural Steel Max CC - 800 CC While we work to ensure that the product information, on the website, is accurate and correct, on occasions, the concerned manufacturers may alter or modify their products' ingredients or configurations, as the case may be. Actual product packaging and materials may contain more and/or different information than that is shown on the Riders Junction website. Riders Junction recommends that you do not solely rely on the product information available on the website and that you always read warnings, descriptions, labels, and directions, printed on the product, before using or consuming a product. For any additional information about a product, please contact the concerned manufacturer or refer to their website. ALL PICTURES SHOWN ARE FOR ILLUSTRATION PURPOSE ONLY. ACTUAL PRODUCT MAY VARY.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"51:T7f6,Chain 428 Pitch X 130 Links (Vx3) SUPERIOR STRENGTH D.I.D’s VX Series chains are high-performance, low-friction X-Ring chains. We have multiple sizes that will fit numerous street and off-road motorcycles. The VX Series has increased rigidity to help reduce pin flex for a smooth ride. LONGER WEAR LIFE D.I.D's VX Series boasts a much longer chain life than the VO Series due to the patented X-Ring technology. PATENTED X-RING The VX chain series showcases the industry-leading, patented X-Ring seal technology, which leads to extended chain life, minimal friction, and overall amazing performance. D.I.D’s PATENTED X-Ring construction reduces friction by twisting between the side plates instead of being squashed. Normal O-rings and other makers’ modified O-rings have squashed points that increase friction. The twisting action of the X-ring disperses the pressure and minimizes power loss. X-Ring is a U.S.A. Registered Trademark of D.I.D; Daido Kogyo Co. Ltd. Japan Features Pin Length: 20.65mm (.813\\\") Pin Dia: 5mm (.197\\\") Plate Thickness In 2 Plate Thickness Out 2 Weight /100L lbs.: 2.66 Tensile Strength : (3365kg) 7420lbs Seal: Yes VX3 Clip Type Color: Natural Steel Chain Life Index: 2700 Max CC: 350 MANUFACTURER: DAIDO KOGYO CO LTD | COUNTRY OF IMPORT: JAPAN While works to ensure that the product information, on the website, is accurate and correct, on occasions, the concerned manufacturers may alter or modify their products' ingredients or configurations, as the case may be. Actual product packaging and materials may contain more and/or different information than that is shown on website. Recommends that you do not solely rely on the product information available on the website and that you always read warnings, descriptions, labels, and directions, printed on the product, before using or consuming the product. For any 