rning: It is crucial to install this rivet only on the correct series of DID chains (VX series). Installing the wrong rivet or using it on a different brand of chain can result in serious safety risks, including chain failure. Important Notes: Manufacturer’s Disclaimer: While we strive to provide accurate and current product information, the manufacturer may change product ingredients or specifications. Actual product packaging may differ from what's presented on the website. Always refer to the packaging for complete instructions and safety warnings. Illustrative Images: All images are for illustration purposes only. Actual product appearance may vary slightly. Ensure the secure and proper functioning of your DID VX X-Ring chain with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type. Selecting the right link for your chain is vital for safety and performance, so always confirm compatibility before installation. Designed for reliability, this rivet will help keep your bike running smoothly and safely. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"7a:Tb0d,DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type for X-Ring Chains (Natural Steel-VX3) Ensure the security and durability of your DID X-Ring chain with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type, designed specifically for VX3 series chains. This high-quality master link is engineered to provide a reliable, long-lasting connection, ensuring your chain performs optimally in demanding conditions. Key Features: Compatibility: This master link is only compatible with DID VX3 X-Ring chains. It will not work with any other DID chain series (VX, VX2, etc.) or chains from other brands. Always ensure you select the correct series (VX3) for a proper fit and secure installation. Rivet Type: The rivet-type design ensures a solid, safe connection that’s built to withstand high-performance loads. It provides a secure bond to your chain, preventing premature wear and improving the overall durability of your motorcycle's drivetrain. Color: Finished in Natural Steel, this master link complements the rugged and durable design of the VX3 series chains, offering a professional, high-performance appearance. Manufacturer: Daido Kogyo Co., Ltd. is a Japanese manufacturer with a long history of producing top-tier chain components. Their products are known for their exceptional quality and are trusted by riders worldwide for both street and off-road use. Safety Warning: Installing this master link on the wrong series or another brand of chain is unsafe . Always double-check the chain series (VX3) to ensure compatibility. Incorrect installation can lead to chain failure and safety risks. Important Notes: Manufacturer's Disclaimer: Although we strive to provide accurate product details, manufacturers may modify product specifications from time to time. As a result, the actual product packaging or configuration may differ from what's shown on the website. Always refer to the product packaging for complete instructions and safety information before use. Illustrative Images: All images shown are for illustration purposes actual product may vary slightly in appearance. The DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type (Natural Steel-VX3) is a must-have for anyone using the VX3 X-Ring chain. Its precision engineering guarantees a secure, reliable connection, essential for maintaining the performance and safety of your motorcycle. Ensure you select the correct master link for your DID chain to keep your bike running smoothly and safely. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.7b:Taa4,DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type for X-Ring Chains (Gold-VX) Ensure the secure and reliable connection of your DID X-Ring chain with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type , specifically designed for the VX series . Engineered for optimal performance, this master link provides the strength and durability needed for high-performance motorcycles. Key Features: Compatibility: This master link is exclusively compatible with the DID VX series X-Ring chains . For example, if you have a VX chain , only the VX master link will fit properly. It is important to match the correct series (VX, VX2, VX3, etc.) to ensure proper fitment. Do not install on chains of a different series or brand as it may compromise safety and performance. Rivet Type: The rivet-type design ensures a secure, long-lasting connection, helping to prevent separation and providing superior tensile strength. It’s ideal for high-stress applications where reliability is critical. Color: Finished in Gold , this master link adds a premium touch to your chain and complements the aesthetics of your bike. Manufacturer: Daido Kogyo Co. Ltd. , the renowned Japanese manufacturer, is trusted worldwide for producing high-quality motorcycle chain components. Their products are crafted to meet the highest performance standards. Safety Warning: Installing the rivet on the wrong chain series or brand is unsafe . Always verify compatibility before installation to ensure the correct series is chosen for your chain. Using the wrong link may result in failure and can be hazardous. Important Notes: Manufacturer’s Disclaimer: While we aim to provide accurate product information, manufacturers occasionally modify their products’ specifications or ingredients. The actual product packaging or configuration may differ from what is shown online. Always check the packaging for detailed instructions and safety information before use. Illustrative Images: The images shown are for illustration purposes only. Actual product appearance may vary slightly. Ensure your DID VX X-Ring chain is maintained with the highest standards of safety and performance with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type . Proper installation and matching the correct series to your chain will guarantee a strong, reliable connection for optimal motorcycle performance. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.7c:T687,Did Chain 520 Pitch x 114 Links (ER)-520ERT3114GRB The Did Chain 520ERT3 is a non-sealed, high-performance motocross chain, used by top factory race teams such as Monster Energy Kawasaki, Star Racing Yamaha, Honda HRC, Red Bull KTM, Factory HEP Suzuki, and more. Known for its unbeatable strength-to-weight ratio, this chain is the go-to choice for professional racers and enthusiasts, especially for riders in the 250cc class. Designed to provide superior performance across various racing disciplines, the Did Chain 520ERT3 is a must-have for serious riders. Why Choose the Did Chain 520ERT3? Factory-Approved: Trusted by professional race teams, including Monster Energy Kawasaki and Honda HRC. Strength-to-Weight Ratio: Built to withstand extreme conditions with a tensile strength of 8,300 lbs while keeping weight minimal at 2.99 lbs per 100 links. Racing Versatility: Ideal for a variety of racing disciplines, especially in the 250cc class. Maximum Durability: With a Chain Life Index of 410, this chain offers extended longevity and reliability on rough terrains. Precision Engineering: Features precision dimensions with a pin length of 0.693\\\" and a pin diameter of 0.21\\\". Specifications Max CC: 450cc Tensile Strength: 8,300 lbs Weight: 2.99 lbs (for 100 links) Seal: None (Non-sealed chain) Chain Life Index: 410 Pin Length: 0.693\\\" Pin Diameter: 0.21\\\" Inner Plate Thickness: 2 mm Outer Plate Thickness: 2 mm Compatibility Honda CRF 250 (2018-2020) Honda CRF 250 R (2018-2020) Honda CRF 250 R (2021 Onwards) Honda CRF 450 X (2021 Onwards) Kawasaki (Various Models) Color \\u0026 Design Color: Gold Style: Non-sealed chain for maximum performance in racing conditions7d:T690,DID Chain 520 Pitch X 106 Links (Zvmx) - 520ZVMXG-106ZB The D.I.D ZVM-X Series utilizes our patented X-Ring seal and has greater strength than the VX Series and is designed for heavyweight motorcycles with tremendous torque and horsepower. The twisting action of the X-Ring® increases its sealing performance and its four contact points minimize power loss. The ZVM-X Series’ Direct Energy Transfer, born from our experience in MotoGP, means greater stretch resistance under load. The ZVM-X chain is a great chain for high-powered street bikes but may also be utilized on adventure bikes. Max CC: 1,200cc Tensile Strength: 8,745 lbs Weight (100L): 3.59 lbs Seal: X-Ring Chain Life Index: 3500 Pin Length: 0.83\\\" Pin Diameter: 0.206\\\" Inner Plate Thickness: 2.2 Outer Plate Thickness: 2.2 Features ZVMX Rivet Type Color: Gold 1200cc MANUFACTURER: DAIDO KOGYO CO LTD | COUNTRY OF IMPORT: JAPAN ALL PICTURES SHOWN ARE FOR ILLUSTRATION PURPOSE ONLY. ACTUAL PRODUCT MAY VARY. While Motousher works to ensure that the product information, on the website, is accurate and correct, on occasions, the concerned manufacturers may alter or modify their products' ingredients or configurations, as the case may be. Actual product packaging and materials may contain more and/or different information than that is shown on Motousher's website. Mother recommends that you do not solely rely on the product information available on the website and that you always read warnings, descriptions, labels, and directions, printed on the product, before using or consuming a product. For any additional information about a product, please contact the concerned manufacturer or refer to their website.7e:Ta8b,DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type for X-Ring Chains (Gold-VX3) Ensure a secure and reliable connection for your DID X-Ring chains with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type. Designed specifically for the VX3 series, this master link ensures a perfect fit and performance every time. It’s engineered with precision by Daido Kogyo Co., Ltd, and is made to keep your chain in optimal working condition. Key Features: Compatibility: This master link is only compatible with DID X-Ring Chains of the specific series you choose. For example, the VX3 Master Link will only fit VX3 chains. It is crucial that the correct series is selected to ensure proper fitment and safety. Rivet Type: The rivet-type design guarantees a solid and durable connection, preventing unwanted separation of the chain while providing high tensile strength and longevity. Color: The master link is finished in Gold, giving it a premium look that matches the sleek, high-performance design of DID X-Ring chains. Manufacturer: Daido Kogyo Co. Ltd., one of the most trusted names in motorcycle chains and related products. Proudly made in Japan, it adheres to the highest standards of quality and performance. Safety Warning: Installing the rivet on an incorrect chain type or another brand of chain is unsafe. This master link is designed specifically for DID chains, and using it on any other brand or series will not provide the proper connection, which could lead to safety issues. Always double-check compatibility before installation. Important Notes: Manufacturer's Disclaimer: While we strive to provide accurate product information, there may be instances where the actual product packaging or specifications differ slightly from what's listed on the website. Always read the product labels and warnings on the packaging, and contact the manufacturer for the most up-to-date information. Illustrative Images: All images shown are for illustration purposes only. The actual product may vary slightly in appearance from what is pictured. Upgrade your chain with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type for a secure, reliable, and safe performance. Perfectly designed for VX3 X-Ring chains, this component ensures a smooth, long-lasting ride. Always ensure compatibility before installation for the best results. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.24:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Chain Kits\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/chain-kits\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",null,{\\\"handle\\\":\\\"chain-kits\\\",\\\"initialCollection\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261591869\\\",\\\"handle\\\":\\\"chain-kits\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Chain Kits