y\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Browse our exclusive collection of Chain Kits on Irani MotoHub.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/chain-sprocket-bike-only-one.png?v=1787078895\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Chain Kits\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub | Premium Motorcycle Performance Parts\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"16\",{}]]\n2d:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:Tb91,66BHP Chain Care Series 66BHP Fully Synthetic Chain Lube – 500 ml Smooth power transfer | Monsoon + dust protection | Longer chain & sprocket life FULLY SYNTHETIC Deep penetration for effective lubrication and protection. WATER-RESISTANT Designed to resist rain and wash-off, making it ideal for Indian monsoon conditions. QUIET + SMOOTH Reduces friction and chain noise for smoother riding. 500 ML VALUE PACK More usage and better value for regular riders, workshops and touring. MADE FOR INDIAN RIDING Built to handle monsoon rain, dust, humidity and daily stop-and-go riding while keeping your drivetrain protected. BEST FOR Daily riders • Touring • Workshops • Long-term maintenance WHAT YOU FEEL Smoother throttle response Less chain slap • Better roll-on • Cleaner running PRODUCT OVERVIEW Engineered for riders who demand performance and durability, the 66BHP Fully Synthetic Chain Lube – 500 ml delivers effective lubrication, protection and smooth power transfer for all types of motorcycles. Its fully synthetic formula penetrates deep into chain links and rollers, forming a protective layer that helps resist water wash-off, reduce friction and protect against rust and corrosion. KEY BENEFITS Fully Synthetic Formula Provides consistent lubrication under load and helps reduce chain wear and elongation over time. Water-Resistant Protection Designed to stay effective in rain, humidity and wet-road conditions, helping reduce wash-off during monsoons. Reduces Noise & Friction Promotes smoother chain movement for better throttle response and reduced chain slap. Anti-Rust & Anti-Corrosion Helps protect metal surfaces and extend chain and sprocket life, especially in coastal and rainy regions. Long-Lasting Performance Fewer reapplications and more riding time. Ideal for regular commuters and touring riders. 500 ml Value Pack Ideal for frequent use, workshops, touring groups and long-term chain maintenance. CLEANER DRIVETRAIN. SMOOTHER RIDE. A properly lubricated chain helps reduce wear, minimize noise and improve power transfer, making your motorcycle feel smoother and more responsive. IDEAL FOR INDIAN CONDITIONS Suitable for city traffic, highways, touring, monsoon riding and dusty roads. Built for real-world Indian riding conditions. HOW TO USE CLEAN Clean the chain first for maximum lubrication and better bonding. APPLY Spray evenly on the inside of the chain while rotating the wheel slowly. SET Allow the lubricant to settle for a short time before riding so it can penetrate and form a protective layer. TIP: Avoid over-spraying. A thin, even coat provides better protection and keeps the chain cleaner. RIDE MORE. MAINTAIN LESS. Whether you're maintaining your daily ride or preparing for a long tour, 66BHP Fully Synthetic Chain Lube – 500 ml helps keep your drivetrain cleaner, quieter and protected for longer. For optimal chain life, clean and lubricate the chain regularly based on your riding conditions.2f:Td2f,Putoline Chain & Engine Degreaser – 500ml is a fast-acting motorcycle cleaning spray developed to remove oil, grease and stubborn grime from drivetrain and engine components. Its powerful formula works quickly on contaminated areas, helping simplify routine cleaning before inspection, servicing or chain lubrication. This motorcycle chain and engine degreaser can be used on chains, sprockets, gears, engine exteriors, frames and other dirty motorcycle parts. It is compatible with chrome, painted surfaces, rubber and plastic when applied according to the product instructions. The water-soluble formula rinses away easily and leaves no unwanted residue behind. Its convenient 500ml aerosol format makes it suitable for home garages, motorcycle detailers and professional workshops. Key Features Fast-acting motorcycle degreasing formula Removes oil, grease and stubborn grime Suitable for chains, gears and sprockets Cleans motorcycle engine exteriors and frames Compatible with chrome and painted surfaces Suitable for compatible rubber and plastic parts Water-soluble formula for easy rinsing Leaves no unwanted cleaning residue Reaches narrow and difficult-to-clean areas Suitable for road and off-road motorcycles Convenient 500ml aerosol application Product SKU 70049 Benefits Helps remove heavy grease from motorcycle chains Prepares chains for fresh lubricant application Makes engine and drivetrain cleaning easier Helps reveal wear, leaks and damaged components Reduces oily buildup around sprockets and frames Rinses away without leaving a greasy coating Suitable for cleaning several motorcycle materials Reduces the need for aggressive manual scrubbing Helps maintain a cleaner motorcycle appearance Suitable for riders and professional workshops Applications Putoline Chain & Engine Degreaser can be used on compatible: Motorcycle drive chains Front and rear sprockets Gears and drivetrain components Motorcycle engine exteriors Frames and swingarms Chrome motorcycle components Painted motorcycle surfaces Compatible rubber components Plastic body and mechanical parts Road, racing and off-road motorcycles Avoid applying the degreaser to hot components. Keep it away from brake discs, brake pads, tyres and other friction surfaces, and confirm compatibility before using it on custom finishes or delicate materials. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: Chain & Engine Degreaser Product Type: Motorcycle chain and engine cleaner Pack Size: 500ml Packaging Type: Aerosol spray SKU: 70049 Formula: Fast-acting, water-soluble degreaser Primary Cleaning Targets: Oil, grease and grime Suitable Components: Chains, gears, engines and frames Compatible Surfaces: Chrome, paint, rubber and plastic Residue: Leaves no residue when correctly rinsed Primary Application: Motorcycle cleaning and maintenance Why Choose Putoline? Putoline specialises in premium lubricants and maintenance products developed exclusively for powered two-wheelers. Its motorcycle-care range includes dedicated products for drivetrain cleaning, lubrication, engine maintenance and surface protection. Chain & Engine Degreaser combines strong cleaning action with broad compatibility across common motorcycle surfaces. Its water-soluble, residue-free formulation makes it a practical choice before chain lubrication, mechanical inspection or detailed motorcycle cleaning.30:Tecc,Putoline Tech Chain – 500ml is a premium motorcycle chain lubricant formulated with ceramic wax, PTFE and advanced protective additives. It creates a durable, low-friction coating that helps reduce chain and sprocket wear while supporting smooth, quiet and efficient drivetrain operation. Its strong adhesive properties allow the lubricant to remain on the chain during high-speed and demanding riding, helping reduce fling onto wheels and surrounding motorcycle components. The wax-based finish also attracts less dust and dirt than heavily sticky chain lubricants, making regular chain maintenance cleaner and easier. Putoline Tech Chain is suitable for compatible sealed O-ring chains, standard motorcycle chains and motocross chains. It is designed for road, racing and off-road motorcycles used by everyday riders, professional workshops and competition teams. Putoline develops its lubricants specifically for powered two-wheelers, while the product is sold in India under SKU 70367. Key Features Premium ceramic-wax motorcycle chain lubricant Formulated with PTFE and advanced additives Creates a durable, low-friction protective layer Suitable for compatible O-ring motorcycle chains Suitable for standard and motocross chains Strong adhesion helps minimise lubricant fling Helps reduce chain and sprocket wear Attracts less dirt than heavily sticky lubricants Supports smooth and quiet chain operation Suitable for road, racing and off-road motorcycles Easy and controlled aerosol application Convenient 500ml spray can Benefits Helps extend motorcycle chain and sprocket life Reduces friction between links, rollers and sprocket teeth Supports smoother and quieter drivetrain performance Helps protect the chain against moisture and corrosion Minimises lubricant splatter around the rear wheel Reduces excessive dust and grime accumulation Maintains dependable lubrication during demanding rides Makes routine chain inspection and cleaning easier Supports efficient transfer of engine power Suitable for home maintenance and professional workshops Applications Putoline Tech Chain can be used on compatible: O-ring motorcycle chains Standard motorcycle drive chains Motocross and MX chains Road motorcycles Sports bikes and superbikes Touring motorcycles Adventure motorcycles Racing and track motorcycles Motocross and enduro motorcycles Trail and off-road motorcycles Always follow the chain manufacturer’s care instructions. Keep the lubricant away from tyres, brake discs, brake pads and other surfaces that depend on friction. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: Tech Chain Product Type: Motorcycle chain lubricant Lubricant Technology: Ceramic-wax formulation Additives: PTFE and protective additives Pack Size: 500ml Packaging Type: Aerosol spray SKU: 70367 Chain Compatibility: Compatible sealed and motocross chains Primary Functions: Lubrication, friction reduction and wear protection Finish: Durable wax-based lubricating film Suitable Use: Road, racing and off-road motorcycles Application Method: Spray directly onto a clean, dry chain The current Indian Putoline listings identify Tech Chain Lube under SKU 70367, while Baycity Power Parts includes chain lubricants within its motorcycle-specific Putoline care range. Why Choose Putoline? Putoline specialises in oils, lubricants and maintenance products developed exclusively for powered two-wheelers. Its range includes motorcycle engine oils, fork oils, chain lubricants and cleaning products for road, racing and off-road applications. Tech Chain combines ceramic-wax lubrication, PTFE protection and strong adhesion in one easy-to-use aerosol. It is a practical option for riders who want dependable chain protection with reduced fling and less dirt accumulation around the drivetrain.31:Te2c,Putoline DX11 Chain Spray – 500ml is a high-performance motorcycle chain lubricant developed to provide deep penetration, strong adhesion and dependable protection in changing riding conditions. Its advanced formula reaches tight spaces between chain links and rollers, creating a durable lubricating layer that helps reduce friction and wear. The water-repellent formulation helps protect the chain against moisture, rust and corrosion. Its super-tacky, low-fling properties allow the lubricant to remain on the chain at higher speeds, helping keep the rear wheel and surrounding drivetrain components cleaner. This motorcycle chain spray is suitable for open chains and compatible O-ring, X-ring and Z-ring chains. It can be used on road, touring, racing and off-road motorcycles requiring reliable chain protection against dust, grime, water and demanding operating loads. Key Features High-performance motorcycle chain lubricant Deep-penetrating formulation Strong, super-tacky adhesion Helps minimise lubricant fling at speed Water-repellent protective action Reduces friction between chain components Helps protect against rust and corrosion Suitable for open motorcycle chains Compatible with O-ring, X-ring and Z-ring chains Suitable for road and off-road motorcycles Precision aerosol application Convenient 500ml spray can Benefits Helps extend motorcycle chain and sprocket life Supports smoother and quieter drivetrain operation Reduces friction between links, rollers and sprocket teeth Protects the chain against rain and moisture exposure Helps prevent rust and corrosion during storage or regular use Minimises lubricant splatter around the rear wheel Maintains lubrication during high-speed riding Helps reduce dust and grime-related wear Makes routine chain maintenance more convenient Suitable for riders and professional motorcycle workshops Applications Putoline DX11 Chain Spray can be used on compatible: Open motorcycle chains O-ring motorcycle chains X-ring motorcycle chains Z-ring motorcycle chains Road motorcycles Sports bikes and superbikes Touring and adventure motorcycles Racing and track motorcycles Motocross motorcycles Enduro, trail and off-road motorcycles Always check the chain manufacturer’s maintenance instructions. Keep the lubricant away from brake discs, brake pads, tyres and other surfaces that depend on friction. Technical Specifications Brand: Putoline Product Name: DX11 Chain Spray Product Type: Motorcycle chain lubricant Pack Size: 500ml Packaging Type: Aerosol spray SKU: 70082 Lubricant Properties: Deep-penetrating and super-tacky Water Resistance: Water-repellent formulation Chain Compatibility: Open, O-ring, X-ring and Z-ring chains Primary Functions: Lubrication, wear reduction and corrosion protection Fling Resistance: High Suitable Use: Street, touring, racing and off-road motorcycles Application Method: Spray directly onto a clean and dry chain Baycity Power Parts identifies DX11 Chain Spray under SKU 70082 and lists it as a deep-penetrating, water-repellent and low-fling lubricant for open and sealed motorcycle chains. Why Choose Putoline? Putoline develops motorcycle-specific engine oils, fork fluids, chain lubricants and maintenance products for road, racing and off-road applications. Its products are formulated to handle the loads, temperatures and environmental exposure experienced by motorcycle components. DX11 Chain Spray combines deep penetration with strong adhesion and water-repellent protection. It is a practical choice for riders who need dependable chain lubrication while reducing fling, corrosion and premature drivetrain wear.32:T64b,Both Inner link and Outer link plates are Brass plated Brass Plated by Sophisticated technology Enhanced rust protection Lustrous aesthetic Designed for pro biking and Racing Suitable Motorcycle: X PULSE 200FI / 200 Front Sprocket (Z) :13 Rear Sprocket (Z) :38 Number of Chain Links :NULL Front Sprocket S 01 179 - 13 Teeth Mountimg :- 1 Tap + Spline Rear Sprocket S 01 1046 - 38 Teeth Mounting :- 4 equispaced Holes on PCD + Bore Chain R520 HPORC - 106 Front Sprocket Reliable with high performance & longer life. Smooth operation & higher transmission accuracy. Anti-resistant coating with Superior quality. Anti-wear performance which lets vehicle move with full power. Produced with Hi-Tech accurate machining which reduces noise and provides s