ls. Zinc coating to provide better rust prevention. Induction hardening to improve wear resistance with outstanding performance. Shot blasted sprockets with improved surface fatigue strength. Sprockets are made of best surface protection treatment which enables to withstand dust and muddy ride with ease. Sprockets are of made with best position accuracy to ensure better fitment capabilities. Good surface finish that makes ride smoother. Chain R520HPOR-108-23b:T875,Rolon-Noise Free Chain Sprocket Kit For KTM Duke 390 Gen 3-HXR 435NF Experience the perfect combination of power, precision, and silence with the Rolon Noise-Free Chain Sprocket Kit, specially engineered for the KTM Duke 390 Gen 3. Whether you're riding through city streets or conquering rugged terrains, this premium kit ensures superior performance and longevity. Front Sprocket Features:- High Durability & Strength: Made using heat-treated alloy steel for extended life and consistent performance. Anti-Wear Technology: Reduces wear and tear even under high load conditions, ensuring smooth power transfer. Noise & Vibration Dampening: Precision machining minimizes vibrations, providing a quieter and more comfortable ride. Corrosion Protection: Anti-resistant coating safeguards against rust, moisture, and environmental degradation. OE-Spec Fitment : Designed for a direct and accurate fit with factory drivetrain systems—no modifications needed. Rigorously Tested: Undergoes 18 manufacturing stages and 15+ quality checks for reliable, long-lasting use. Rear Sprocket Features:- Premium Carbon Steel Construction: Built to handle extreme riding conditions, including off-road and wet environments. Induction-Hardened Teeth: Enhances wear resistance and reduces the need for frequent replacements. Zinc-Coated Surface: Offers excellent rust prevention for all-weather reliability. Shot-Blasted Finish: Improves fatigue resistance and overall sprocket life, even in demanding terrain. Precision Engineering: Ensures perfect alignment and fitment, eliminating chain slack and uneven wear. Dust & Debris Protection: Special surface treatment resists mud and grime, reducing maintenance needs. Smooth Operation: Low-friction surface finish enables efficient, noise-free transmission for an enjoyable ride. Kit Contents:- Front Sprocket (Z): 15 Teeth Rear Sprocket (Z): 43 Teeth Chain Links: 103 Additional Info:- Specification Details Product Name Rolon Noise-Free Chain Sprocket Kit Compatible Model KTM Duke 390 Gen 3 Model Code HXR 435NF Brand Rolon Weight Approx. 2 kg Front Sprocket (Z) 15 Teeth Rear Sprocket (Z) 43 Teeth Number of Chain Links 103 Links3c:Tccc,Rolon Brass Chain Kit for KTM Duke 390 / Adventure 390 (KIT HXRC 507) – High Performance Drive Chain & Sprocket Kit The Rolon Brass Chain Kit KIT HXRC 507 is a premium-grade motorcycle chain and sprocket kit designed specifically for the KTM Duke 390 and KTM Adventure 390. Engineered for superior strength, smooth power delivery, and long-lasting durability, this drivetrain kit is ideal for riders who demand high performance for daily commuting, touring, and aggressive riding conditions. Premium Brass-Plated Chain for Enhanced Durability This high-performance chain features brass-coated links that provide improved resistance against rust, corrosion, and harsh weather conditions. It ensures smoother operation and extended lifespan compared to standard chains, making it highly suitable for Indian road and climate conditions. Precision-Engineered Sprocket Set The kit includes high-strength, precision-machined steel sprockets designed for optimal fitment and performance. These sprockets ensure efficient power transfer from the engine to the rear wheel, improving overall riding stability and responsiveness. Optimized Fitment for KTM 390 Platform Specially designed for the KTM 390 platform, this chain kit is compatible with both Duke 390 and Adventure 390 models (subject to variant and year compatibility). It ensures proper alignment, smooth engagement, and reliable drivetrain performance. Enhanced Riding Performance & Smooth Power Delivery The Rolon HXRC 507 chain kit is engineered to deliver smoother throttle response, reduced chain noise, and consistent power transmission. It enhances riding comfort and improves control across city roads, highways, and off-road conditions. Built for Touring & Long-Distance Reliability Designed for riders who frequently travel long distances, this chain kit offers improved resistance to wear and better tension stability over time. It is ideal for touring motorcycles that require dependable drivetrain performance under continuous load. Key Features & Benefits Premium brass-plated chain for corrosion resistance High-strength steel sprockets with precision machining Improved durability for touring and daily use Smoother power delivery and reduced vibration Optimized for KTM Duke 390 & Adventure 390 Enhanced chain life under Indian road conditions Stable performance in high-load riding situations Technical Specifications Product Code: KIT HXRC 507 Compatibility: KTM Duke 390 / KTM Adventure 390 Chain Type: Brass-Plated Heavy Duty Drive Chain Sprocket Material: High-Strength Steel Important Compatibility Note Before purchasing, always confirm the exact model year and generation of your KTM 390 (Duke or Adventure) to ensure proper fitment. Chain length and sprocket tooth configuration may vary depending on the variant. Ideal For Perfect for KTM riders, touring enthusiasts, highway commuters, and performance riders who want a durable and reliable upgrade over standard OEM chain kits. Why Choose Rolon Brass Chain Kit HXRC 507? The Rolon HXRC 507 chain kit delivers the perfect balance of durability, performance, and smooth power transmission. It is built to handle demanding riding conditions while offering improved longevity and reduced maintenance, making it a trusted choice for KTM 390 owners.3d:T747,Product Features Suitable Motorcycle: KTM Front Sprocket (Z) : 14T Rear Sprock