 the VX series and cannot be used with the VX3 or any other DID chain series. Always verify your chain series before installing to ensure proper fit and safety. Rivet Type: The rivet-type design ensures a robust and secure connection between chain links. This provides strength, stability, and durability for the most demanding riding conditions, keeping your chain intact and reliable. Color: Finished in Gold , this master link complements the high-performance look of your DID VX chain , offering both strength and a sleek aesthetic. Manufacturer: Daido Kogyo Co. Ltd. , a reputable manufacturer from Japan, is known worldwide for producing top-quality motorcycle chain components. Their products are designed for superior durability and performance, trusted by riders globally. Safety Warning: This rivet is specifically designed for DID VX series chains . Using the wrong series or a different brand of chain can result in unsafe installation , leading to chain failure or accidents. Always ensure compatibility before use. Important Notes: Manufacturer’s Disclaimer: Although we strive to provide accurate product details, the manufacturer may modify product ingredients or specifications. As a result, the actual product packaging or configuration may differ slightly from what is shown on the website. Always read the warnings, descriptions, and directions on the packaging before use. Illustrative Images: All images are for illustration purposes only. The actual product may vary slightly in appearance. The DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type (Gold - VX) is essential for ensuring your DID VX X-Ring chain operates smoothly and safely. Correct installation and compatibility are crucial to ensure the chain remains securely connected. Always double-check your chain series before installation to guarantee the best performance and safety. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.76:T685,DID Chain 525 Pitch X 124 Links (Zvmx2) - 525ZVMX2G-124ZB The D.I.D ZVM-X Series utilizes our patented X-Ring seal and has greater strength than the VX Series and is designed for heavyweight motorcycles with tremendous torque and horsepower. The twisting action of the X-Ring® increases its sealing performance and its four contact points minimize power loss. The ZVM-X Series’ Direct Energy Transfer, born from our experience in MotoGP, means greater stretch resistance under load. The ZVM-X chain is a great chain for high-powered street bikes but may also be utilized on adventure bikes. Max CC: 1,300cc Tensile Strength: 10,408 lbs Weight (100L): 4.65 lbs Seal: X-Ring Chain Life Index: 4,000 Pin Length: 0.913\" Pin Diameter: 0.217\" Inner Plate Thickness: 2.4 Outer Plate Thickness: 2.6 Features ZVM-X- 2 Rivet Type Color: Silver MANUFACTURER: DAIDO KOGYO CO LTD | COUNTRY OF IMPORT: JAPAN Disclaimer: While works to ensure that the product information, on the website, is accurate and correct, on occasions, the concerned manufacturers may alter or modify their products' ingredients or configurations, as the case may be. Actual product packaging and materials may contain more and/or different information than that is shown on website. Recommends that you do not solely rely on the product information available on the website and that you always read warnings, descriptions, labels, and directions, printed on the product, before using or consuming the product. For any additional information about a product, please contact the concerned manufacturer or refer to their website. ALL PICTURES SHOWN ARE FOR ILLUSTRATION PURPOSE ONLY. ACTUAL PRODUCT MAY VARY.77:T681,DID Chain 530 Pitch X 118 Links (Zvmx2) - 530ZVMX-2G11