ning: Installing the rivet on an incorrect chain type or another brand of chain is unsafe. This master link is designed specifically for DID chains, and using it on any other brand or series will not provide the proper connection, which could lead to safety issues. Always double-check compatibility before installation. Important Notes: Manufacturer's Disclaimer: While we strive to provide accurate product information, there may be instances where the actual product packaging or specifications differ slightly from what's listed on the website. Always read the product labels and warnings on the packaging, and contact the manufacturer for the most up-to-date information. Illustrative Images: All images shown are for illustration purposes only. The actual product may vary slightly in appearance from what is pictured. Upgrade your chain with the DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type for a secure, reliable, and safe performance. Perfectly designed for VX3 X-Ring chains, this component ensures a smooth, long-lasting ride. Always ensure compatibility before installation for the best results. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.24:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Chain Kits\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/chain-kits\\\"}]}\"}