 demanding riding conditions, keeping your chain intact and reliable. Color: Finished in Gold , this master link complements the high-performance look of your DID VX chain , offering both strength and a sleek aesthetic. Manufacturer: Daido Kogyo Co. Ltd. , a reputable manufacturer from Japan, is known worldwide for producing top-quality motorcycle chain components. Their products are designed for superior durability and performance, trusted by riders globally. Safety Warning: This rivet is specifically designed for DID VX series chains . Using the wrong series or a different brand of chain can result in unsafe installation , leading to chain failure or accidents. Always ensure compatibility before use. Important Notes: Manufacturer’s Disclaimer: Although we strive to provide accurate product details, the manufacturer may modify product ingredients or specifications. As a result, the actual product packaging or configuration may differ slightly from what is shown on the website. Always read the warnings, descriptions, and directions on the packaging before use. Illustrative Images: All images are for illustration purposes only. The actual product may vary slightly in appearance. The DID Chain Master Link Rivet Type (Gold - VX) is essential for ensuring your DID VX X-Ring chain operates smoothly and safely. Correct installation and compatibility are crucial to ensure the chain remains securely connected. Always double-check your chain series before installation to guarantee the best performance and safety. IMPORTANT NOTE : ZVMX master links are exclusively compatible with ZVMX chains only. VX3 master links are exclusively compatible with VX3 chains only. These master links will NOT fit properly in other DID series chains, OEM chains, or any other chain types. Using incompatible master links creates safety risks and liability issues for the customer. Master links are not intended to modify or increase chain length.4b:T685,DID Chain 525 Pitch X 124 Links (Zvmx2) - 525ZV